@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5163

### Health check
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### --- Projects ---

### Create project
# @name createProject
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sample Project",
  "description": "Created via backend.http",
  "status": "Active"
}

###
@projectId = {{createProject.response.body.id}}

### List projects
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/projects

### Get project
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}

### --- Tasks ---

### Create task with baseline timeline (L2 seeds L1)
# @name createTask
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Design MVP schema",
  "description": "Initial task",
  "status": "NotStarted",
  "currentTimeline": {
    "start": "2026-04-24T00:00:00Z",
    "end":   "2026-04-28T00:00:00Z"
  }
}

###
@taskId = {{createTask.response.body.id}}

### List tasks by project
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks

### Update task (shift CurrentTimeline → auto change log)
PUT {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Design MVP schema",
  "status": "InProgress",
  "currentTimeline": {
    "start": "2026-04-25T00:00:00Z",
    "end":   "2026-04-30T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "changeReason": "Scope expanded to include matrix load API",
  "changedBy": "ysh"
}

### Mark real completion (L3) → auto change log
PUT {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Design MVP schema",
  "status": "Done",
  "currentTimeline": {
    "start": "2026-04-25T00:00:00Z",
    "end":   "2026-04-30T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "realTimeline": {
    "start": "2026-04-25T00:00:00Z",
    "end":   "2026-04-29T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "changeReason": "Finished one day earlier",
  "changedBy": "ysh"
}

### --- Change logs ---

### Full history for the task
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/change-logs?entityType=Task&entityId={{taskId}}&limit=50

### --- Resources ---

### Create resource (human)
# @name createResource
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/resources
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ysh",
  "role": "Owner",
  "capacityPercent": 100
}

###
@resourceId = {{createResource.response.body.id}}

### List resources
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/resources

### --- Assignments ---

### Create assignment
# @name createAssignment
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": "{{resourceId}}",
  "taskId": "{{taskId}}",
  "allocationPercent": 60,
  "start": "2026-04-25T00:00:00Z",
  "end":   "2026-04-30T00:00:00Z"
}

###
@assignmentId = {{createAssignment.response.body.id}}

### List assignments for a resource
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/assignments?resourceId={{resourceId}}

### --- Matrix load view ---

### Integrated load view for a week
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/matrix/load?from=2026-04-24T00:00:00Z&to=2026-05-01T00:00:00Z

### --- Milestones ---

### Create milestone
# @name createMilestone
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/milestones
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "MVP ready",
  "date": "2026-04-30T00:00:00Z",
  "status": "Upcoming"
}

###
@milestoneId = {{createMilestone.response.body.id}}

### List milestones
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/milestones

### --- Cleanup (optional) ---

### Delete assignment
# DELETE {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}

### Delete milestone
# DELETE {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/milestones/{{milestoneId}}

### Delete task
# DELETE {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}

### Delete resource
# DELETE {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/resources/{{resourceId}}

### Delete project (cascades tasks)
# DELETE {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
